  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">XSML is raising ARF IV to build on the successful strategies of ARF and ARF III. The Fund uses a mix of mezzanine and equity investments to build a diversified portfolio of SME investments. ARF IV will target a portfolio of some 40-50 investees with average target ticket sizes between USD 2-3m. The core geographical focus of the Fund will include Angola, the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Zambia and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
